
## Quick Start — Build E-NJOY

1Material List: 
1] Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+ — 1GB RAM
2] Rspberry Pi Touch Display 2 — 7"
3] 64GB microSD card
4] 10,000mAh USB power bank
5] PAM8403 stereo amplifier
6] 2 × 4Ω 3W speakers
7] 4 × tactile buttons
8] Jumper wires
9] 400-point breadboard
10] Enclosure materials

2Prepare the Raspberry Pi: 
1]Install Raspberry Pi OS onto the 64GB microSD card.
2]Insert the card into the Raspberry Pi.
3]Connect the 7" touchscreen.
4]Power the Pi using the power bank.
5]Complete the initial Raspberry Pi setup.

3Build the electronics
Build the electronics according to the proposed wiring in the schematic folder and THEN CONTINUE-->

4Install the E-NJOY software
Install it from the software folder 

Run the E-NJOY application from the software/ folder. The touchscreen should display the E-NJOY interface.

5Then test:

Touchscreen
Buttons
Audio output
Speakers
Power
E-NJOY interface

**Finally add it to the enclosure and case it and E-NJOY !!
